@startuml j6-clinic-file-edit
!include style.iuml
title J6 Clinic file edit: checked save and reset
actor Staff
participant "Staff page /staff\n(clinic section)" as SP
participant "GET /api/clinic" as C
participant "POST /api/tickets" as T
database "Shared store" as Store
participant "POST /api/chat" as Api
actor Patient
autonumber

Staff -> SP : opens the clinic data section
SP -> C : GET
C -> Store : getClinicData()
C --> SP : the clinic file in use (the shipped file when the store is down)
Staff -> SP : edits the file and presses Save
SP -> T : POST {clinic}
T -> T : isStaff, then the Zod check (ClinicSchema)
alt a needed part is missing or empty, or the file is over 100,000 characters
  T --> SP : 400 "Invalid clinic data: <where>"
  SP --> Staff : the save is refused; the file in use is unchanged
else the file is whole
  T -> Store : saveClinicData(clinic)
  T --> SP : {ok: true, clinic}
  SP --> Staff : saved
end
note right of T
Needed: clinic name, address, phone and emergency phone;
hours; at least one doctor; at least one service with a
price; policies. Anything else in the file is kept as it is.
end note

Patient -> Api : asks about the edited timing or price
Api -> Store : getClinicData()
Api --> Patient : the reply follows the edit

opt put the original back
  Staff -> SP : Reset
  SP -> T : POST {clinicReset: true}
  T -> Store : saveClinicData(the file that ships with the app)
  T --> SP : {ok: true, clinic}
end
@enduml
